                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p><strong>Before First Use:</strong></p><p><strong>1. WASH</strong><br/>Hand wash the bottle 2�3 times with mild dish soap and clean water. Rinse thoroughly.</p><p><strong>2. RINSE THE DIFFUSER</strong><br/>Rinse the Mineral Activation Diffuser thoroughly under running water.</p><p><strong>3. INSERT + SHAKE</strong><br/>Insert the diffuser securely into the bottle and tighten. Fill the bottle with clean water, close securely, and shake well.</p><p><strong>4. EMPTY + REPEAT</strong><br/>Pour out the water and repeat the fill, shake, and empty process until the water runs clear.</p><p>Your CELLNERGY HYDRATION SYSTEM is now ready to use.</p>",
